.Dd August 22, 2026
.Dt MAC_GROK 8
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm mac_grok
.Nd orchestrate
.Xr mac_lomac_grok 8
and
.Xr mac_generic_grok 8
with ZFS snapshots
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Ar command
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
is the suite
.Xr rc.subr 8
script.
It is the only component that takes
.Xr zfs 8
snapshots
.Pq filesystems and zvols
and optional
.Xr zpool-checkpoint 8 .
Children are invoked with
.Ev MAC_LOMAC_GROK_SKIP_SNAPSHOT Ns =1 .
.Pp
.Va mac_grok_enable
defaults to
.Dq NO .
Use
.Xr service 8
.Dq one Ns Ar command .
.Sh COMMANDS
.Bl -tag -width snapshot_after
.It Cm install
Install this script and, if present in the result directory, the
child packages.
.It Cm snapshot
.Em Before
any policy mutation:
.Cm zfs snapshot Fl r
.Ar pool Ns @mac_grok-pre- Ns Ar utc
covering all descendant filesystems and volumes.
Checkpoint only if
.Ev CHECKPOINT Ns =1 .
.It Cm snapshot_after
.Em After
.Cm stage :
the same
.Fl r
snapshot with a
.Dq post
tag.
No second checkpoint.
.It Cm stage
Child
.Cm stage
commands.
.It Cm update
Child
.Cm update
.Pq Xr login.conf 5 , POLICIES .
.It Cm start , Cm stop , Cm status
Delegate to children.
.It Cm test Ns Ar command
Dry-run
.Pq Cm testsnapshot , Cm teststage , Cm testupdate , Cm testuninstall , Cm teststart .
No modifications.
.It Cm uninstall
Child
.Cm uninstall
then remove
.Nm
files and manuals.
Does not destroy ZFS snapshots; names remain in
.Pa /var/db/mac_grok/zfs.snaps .
.El
.Sh FILES
.Pa /usr/local/etc/rc.d/mac_grok ,
.Pa /var/db/mac_grok/zfs.snaps
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr mac_grok 4 ,
.Xr mac_grok 7 ,
.Xr mac_lomac_grok 8 ,
.Xr mac_generic_grok 8 ,
.Xr zfs 8 ,
.Xr zpool-checkpoint 8
.Sh BUGS
.Xr zpool-checkpoint 8
rewind discards later transactions and the checkpoint.
See the suite
.Pa README
section
.Dq Known issues
and the child package READMEs.

